Description:
[b][size=5]How to use[/size]
<br />[/b][b]As a User
<br />[/b]Download and extract into your mod folder
<br />
<br />[b]As a Mod Author[/b]
<br />Here's an example on how to use it.
<br />[spoiler]
<br />[b]Robin Build Menu[/b]
<br />[code]{
<br />   "Action": "EditData",
<br />   "Target": "Data/TriggerActions",
<br />   "Entries": {
<br />      "ExampleTriggerAction": {
<br />         "Id": "ExampleTriggerAction",
<br />         "Trigger": "&lt;your trigger&gt;",
<br />         "Condition": "&lt;your condition&gt;",
<br />         "Action": "Sl1mb.CBM/OpenBuildMenu"
<br />      }
<br />   }
<br />}
<br />[/code]
<br />[b]Marnie Animal Menu[/b]
<br />[code]﻿{
<br />   "Action": "EditData",
<br />   "Target": "Data/TriggerActions",
<br />   "Entries": {
<br />      "ExampleTriggerAction": {
<br />         "Id": "ExampleTriggerAction",
<br />         "Trigger": "&lt;your trigger&gt;",
<br />         "Condition": "&lt;your condition&gt;",
<br />         "Action": "Sl1mb.CBM/OpenAnimalMenu"
<br />      }
<br />   }
<br />}
<br />[/code]
<br />[/spoiler]
<br />[size=5][b]Attention
<br />[/b][/size]This mod is under development. It was made for a project I'm working on.
